WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I've got so much for you to put away now.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,120
And you have to categorize it for me, okay, okay, do you want to send it?

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,080
Don’t rush to post yet

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,920
If you want to give it out, it should also be given to the soldiers who carry it.

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,080
Others will not send it first

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,400
Wait until I get something similar

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,600
We send it out once

8
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,120
That way no one will feel unfair.

9
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,720
I have to collect a lot of clothes

10
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,920
Moving around is not an option.

11
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:21,500
How about buying a tricycle boss?

12
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,700
How much is this tricycle? One thousand yuan

13
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,460
Can it be cheaper? You see, it’s not easy for me either.

14
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,780
Everything on me is old stuff.

15
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,820
I'm just a loser who collects used goods.

16
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:38,580
This is already the lowest, okay, then nine hundred guys

17
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,860
Do you want to buy wolf poison and rat poison, sir?

18
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:44,020
Where did you buy the thing you are talking about? How much does it cost for one? What am I doing to entertain you?

19
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,100
If you don't buy anything, get out.

20
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,820
If anyone has time to tell you these things, please tell me.

21
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:49,980
I'll give you five dollars, okay?

22
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,570
Get the money first

23
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:53,050
Just go to the grocery store and buy it.

24
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:54,370
What's the name of this thing?

25
00:00:54,370 --> 00:00:56,050
Are you afraid that there is something wrong with your head?

26
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,690
This is an ordinary speaker speaker

27
00:00:57,690 --> 00:01:00,170
What a strange name. Thank you, sir.
